<title>UK: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of men's Euroleague</p>
<p>basketball matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p>In Istanbul: Ulker Spor (Turkey) 73 Teamsystem Bologna</p>
<p>(Italy) 78.</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Ulker Spor - Mark Godfread 22, Orhun Ene 13.</p>
<p>Teamsystem Bologna - Carlton Myers 22, Alessandro Frosini</p>
<p>14.</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>In Tel Aviv: Maccabi Tel Aviv (Israel) 82 Olympiakos</p>
<p>(Greece) 78 (halftime 44-44)</p>
<p>Group H</p>
<p>In Bologna: Kinder Bologna (Italy) 73 Split (Croatia) 57</p>
<p>(Halftime 45-23)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Bologna - Walter Magnifico 16, Alessandro Abbio 13</p>
<p>Group E</p>
<p>In Milan: Stefanel Milan (Italy) 80 Alba Berlin (Germany) 91</p>
<p>(Halftime 49-45)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Stefanel - Warren Kidd 24, Anthony Bowie 13, Flavio</p>
<p>Portaluppi 10</p>
<p>Alba - Wendell Alexis 20, Sasa Obradovic 19, Marko Pesic 16</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p>In Zagreb: Cibona Zagreb (Croatia) 72 Limoges (France)  66</p>
<p>(37-28)</p>
<p>Leading Scorers:</p>
<p>Cibona - Damir Mulaomerovic 24, Djevad Alihodzic 13, Zdravko</p>
<p>Radulovic 12.</p>
<p>Limoges - Markovic 14, Bonato 13, Ruffin 7.</p>
<p>Group F</p>
<p>In Madrid:</p>
<p>Estudiantes (Spain) 92  Panionios (Greece) 70 (44-31)</p>
<p>Group H</p>
<p>In Belgrade:</p>
<p>Partizan Belgrade (Yugoslavia) 89 Bayer Leverkusen (Germany)</p>
<p>76</p>
</text>
